## 📈 Planned Analysis

### 1. Executive KPIs

* Total events
* Total users
* Total sessions
* Total purchases
* Revenue
* Average Order Value
* Conversion rate

### 2. Revenue Analysis

* Daily revenue
* Weekly revenue
* Monthly revenue
* Revenue growth
* Revenue by category
* Revenue by brand
* Revenue by product

### 3. Customer Analytics

* Customer activity
* Purchasing customers
* Purchase frequency
* Customer revenue
* Customer lifetime value
* New vs returning customers

### 4. Funnel Analysis

```text
VIEW
 ↓
CART
 ↓
PURCHASE
```

Metrics:

* View → Cart conversion
* Cart → Purchase conversion
* View → Purchase conversion
* Cart abandonment
* Funnel performance by category
* Funnel performance by product

### 5. Product Analytics

* Most viewed products
* Most purchased products
* Highest-revenue products
* High-view / low-purchase products
* Product conversion rate
* Category performance
* Brand performance

### 6. RFM Analysis

Customers will be segmented using:

```text
R = Recency
F = Frequency
M = Monetary
```

Potential segments include:

* Champions
* Loyal Customers
* Recent Customers
* Potential Customers
* At-Risk High-Value Customers
* Inactive Customers

### 7. Cohort Analysis

The project will analyze:

* Customer acquisition cohorts
* Monthly retention
* Repeat purchasing
* Cohort revenue
* Customer lifecycle behavior

---

